    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in excess of 625,000\n\n“A Forever Home” - An impressive 5 bedroom 4 bathroom Dormer Bungalow on c 0.75 acre site. The property is located within a 12 minute drive of Wexford town and within a 10 minute drive of the N11 motorway.\nThis bright and spacious family home has been constructed to the highest specification and finished to exacting standards. \nOn entry to the large entrance hallway, it is hard not to be impressed by the design and attention to detail. Down the hallway the kitchen/dinning/living area, you are greeted with stunning vistas of the south facing landscaped garden and views of the Forth Mountain. Top of the range integrated kitchen appliances are in evidence in the bespoke fitted kitchen with granite worktops. Both the lounge and the kitchen/dinning/living room have large multi-fuel burning stoves. \nAll 5 bedrooms are large doubles with 3 having en-suites. There is also a large main bathroom with jacuzzi bath and separate shower. \nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a wonderful modern residence presented in pristine condition throughout which enjoys all the benefits of tranquil country living with the amenities of Wexford town close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nReception Hall - 6.43m x 2.67m\nBright and spacious with tiled Flooring andHot Press. Magnificent staircase.\n\nLiving Room - 7.36m x 5.92m\nFantastic room for entertaining, dual aspect, with semi solid oak flooring, feature fireplace with multi-fuel stove, TV Pointand Bay Window.\n\nKitchen/dining/lounge open plan area - 7.24m x 9.32m\nHuge living area with tiled flooring, feature fireplace with multi-fuel stove.Double doors onto granite patio and beautiful rear garden.Bespoke fully fitted solid oak kitchen units with island and granite worktops.Stanley range style cooker.Top of the range integrated appliancesCeramic hob an oven.\n\nUtility Room - 3m x 3m\nTiled Floor.Built in units and shelving.Plumbed for washing machine.Door to rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.12m x 3.52m\nCarpeted.Fitted wardrobes.Built in office workspace.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.77m x 4.11m\nCarpeted, presently used as an office.Bay window.\n\nEnsuite - \nTiled with mains shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 Ensuite - 4.46m x 3.70m\nSemi solid oak floor.Fitted wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 3.90m x 2.70m\nTiled Floor and part tiled wallsJacuzzi bath.Separate power shower, w.c and w.h.b.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 2.64m x 2.10m\nWith storage area in eves.Velux window.\n\nBedroom 4 Ensuite - 5.55m x 4.70m\nSemi-solid oak floor.Fitted wardrobes with corner vanity unit.Velux windows.\n\nEnsuite - \nWith tiled flooring and part tiled walls, w.c. w.h.b and mains shower.\n\nMaster Bedroom ensuite - 4.71m x 4.54m\nDressing area (2.88m x 2.4m) with fitted wardrobes.Further range of built-in wardrobes and storageSemi solid oak floors.Velux window.\n\nEnsuite bathroom - 3m x 3m\nSpacious, tiled with bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nDetached garage - 9m x 5m\nFantastic addition to any home.\n\nWorkshop - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Electric entrance gates</li><li>Mature secluded landscaped site planted with lawns and bordered with mature hedging and trees</li><li>Tarmacadam driveway with ample parking </li><li>Seating areas within the garden</li><li>Granite patio area to rear surrounded with attractive raised flower beds</li><li>High speed broadband</li><li>O.F.C.H.</li><li>Bio-degradable percolation system</li><li>Private well</li><li>School buses serve the area for local primary and secondary schools</li><li>Monitored alarm</li><li>Numerous beaches and golf courses within a half hour drive</ul>"
